From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:06:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] FORK-10 5a: the world's harm reaches mod entities (fall,
 lava, fire, burning, explosions, lasers)

Mod entities now fall with vanilla's gravity and a fall past 3 blocks hurts; lava and fire hurt every 10 ticks and set them burning, burning hurts a second, water puts it out (entity_kind's new fire_immune skips the fire); a blast in reach hurts them by distance and exposure; damage-entities-in-box hits those in its box. Every hurt goes through mod-entity-damaged with its damage type and tags, and death through mod-entity-died. Arrows and mob blows do not reach them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
